WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.479 --> 00:00:05.655
Drag near the middle for the red hour hand. The minutes follow.

2
00:00:05.655 --> 00:00:07.980
Drag the blue minute hand past 12, and the hour moves on.

3
00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.081
Back past 12, and the hour goes back.

4
00:00:11.081 --> 00:00:15.422
At 10:30 the hour hand is halfway between 10 and 11.

5
00:00:15.422 --> 00:00:21.650
Today’s task: from 10:30, add 15 minutes four times.

6
00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:25.270
Four 15s make an hour: a light ring and +1 h.

7
00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:30.839
Totals off hides the digital time, so students read the face.

8
00:00:30.839 --> 00:00:39.341
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
